 the state of Minas Gerais, Brazil's second-most populous state. It is the first planned modern city in Brazil.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Praca_do_Papa%2C_Belo_Horizonte_%28cropped%292.jpg/330px-Praca_do_Papa%2C_Belo_Horizonte_%28cropped%292.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belo_Horizonte"},"twins":["Q3579","Q131301","Q597","Q2280","Q8810","Q1297","Q5776","Q518431","Q25395","Q8673","Q165972","Q2900"]}